FILES YOU DO NOT NEED TO ALTER:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

dut/apb_dummy.sv:
  Dummy APB slave, provides non-trivial data on read cycles
  and reports all active cycles to the console.
  
apb_harness.sv:
  Test harness and test-signals interface, unchanged
  from the answer to the previous exercise

apb_classes.sv:
  Package of APB transaction classes, largely unchanged from
  the previous answer.  Stimulus generator now uses a template object.
  In the data class APB_Trans, methods copy(), compare() and 
  psprint() are now virtual so that they can be overridden.
  PLEASE INSPECT THIS FILE to be sure you understand how the
  "template object" mechanism is used in class APB_Stream.
  
apb_pkg.sv
  Package that includes all the classes
  

FILES YOU NEED TO WORK ON:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

mem_map_apb_trans.sv
  In this file you should create a derived transaction data class with
  randomisation constraints.

apb_tb.sv:
  Top-level module, taken from the previous answer.  In this file
  you should modify the test to use your new class.
